{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/966497-helping-creating-an-angel","id":966497,"title":"Helping creating an Angel","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-09T17:29:11-07:00","id":966497,"title":"Helping creating an Angel","content":"I'm looking to create a Destroyer that kills people through lust be it just having coitus with the person till they die or using that persons lust to do something that will get them killed. <br /> <br /> I wanted to know what kind of Numina should this Destroyer have ?<br /> <br /> The Angel is gonna be either rank 2 or 3 so far I'm leaning to rank 2. <br /> <br /> So far I was thinking about Drain, Emotional Aura, Rapture <br /> <br /> Anything else that might work ?<br /> <br /> Maybe I should also create a 1001 Angels Topic for people to put angels they've made.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-09T20:50:22-07:00","id":966568,"title":"","content":"Aggressive Meme seems particularly apt, as does Hallucination and Implant Mission.<br /> <br /> You seem to be trying to decide between an assassin who targets one individual, and an agent provocateur who destabilizes groups. Consider how you want your angel to operate, then choose Numina based on your concept.<br /> <br /> If your angel has a stalker-ish/Yandere personality, Blink of an Eye and No Exit could be very good for creating an angel who just cannot, absolutely will not, let their target get away. Seek is good for the same purpose. Strength Through Adversity as a Numina could be used for gas-lighting purposes.<br /> <br /> Since I recently saw &quot;Gone Girl,&quot; throw in Open Investigation to ruin a target's life.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2233,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","user":"Agentwestmer","date":". 09-10-2016, 08:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-10T13:05:40-07:00","id":966878,"title":"","content":"Well I was thinking she killed her targets but in turn by this target getting removed it also causes wider spreed problems in that social circle like pulling a linchpin in an infrastructure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-10T17:01:10-07:00","id":966997,"title":"","content":"Agent provocateur then.<br /> <br /> Find The Leak and Social Dynamics as Numina for finding a group's weakest link. Trust No One could make a target particularly vulnerable to the angel's advances.<br /> <br /> Mortal Mask is necessary if the angel is going to appear as a human, not a bio-mechanical horror.<br /> <br /> Recommended Influences would probably be something along the line of 'suspicion' or 'treason' .<br /> <br /> The Lady In Red from the GMC fills a very similar niche to what you're going after.","signature"